is twice differentiable at $x=a.$ Then, the quadratic Taylor polynomial of $f$ about $a$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x) & ≈f(a)+{f}^{′}(a)(x-a)+\\frac{1}{2}(x-a)^{T}{f}^{″}(a)(x-a),\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere\n\n$$\n{f}^{′}(a)={\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{1}} & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{∂f}{∂{x}_{n}}\\end{bmatrix}|}_{x=a}\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n{f}^{″}(a)={\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}^{2}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{1}∂{x}_{n}} \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{1}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}^{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{2}∂{x}_{n}} \\\\ ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ & ⋮ \\\\ \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{1}} & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}∂{x}_{2}} & ⋯ & \\frac{{∂}^{2}f}{∂{x}_{n}^{2}}\\end{bmatrix}}_{x=a}\n$$\n\nIn this case, we have $a=\\begin{bmatrix}\\pi  \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},$ and the following data:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(a) & =-1, & \\,{f}^{′}(a) & =\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1+\\pi \\end{bmatrix}, & \\,{f}^{″}(a) & =\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the second-degree Taylor polynomial is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)≈-1+\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1+\\pi \\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x-\\pi  \\\\ y-1 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}+\\frac{1}{2}{\\begin{bmatrix}x-\\pi  \\\\ y-1 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}}^{T}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}x-\\pi  \\\\ y-1 \\\\ z\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nFinally, evaluating the polynomial at $x=\\begin{bmatrix}\\pi  \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(\\pi ,0,1) & ≈-1+\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1+\\pi \\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\pi -\\pi  \\\\ 0-1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+\\frac{1}{2}{\\begin{bmatrix}\\pi -\\pi  \\\\ 0-1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}}^{T}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}\\pi -\\pi  \\\\ 0-1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =-1+\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 0 & 1+\\pi \\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+\\frac{1}{2}{\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}}^{T}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =-1+1+\\pi +\\frac{1}{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 & -1 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\pi +\\frac{1}{2}(3) \\\\  & =\\pi +\\frac{3}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045443] [17592186367902 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186367903 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367902 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186367904 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367902 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186367905 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367902 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186367906 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367902 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186367907 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367902 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367902 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367902 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186367904 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367902 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "0fe8cfa7-31d7-5120-9151-09adc2f21518" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367903 #edb/ref 1080 "\\pi -2" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367903 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367903 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c2b6bcc1-8db6-5e4c-b7a4-47335b00fb23" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367904 #edb/ref 1080 "\\pi +\\frac{3}{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367904 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367904 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "de6fddc6-e1b9-5d30-9c0c-893cee0b8134" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367905 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\pi }^{2}+3" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367905 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367905 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "49cb1040-19f7-5f49-9ce0-3dd45d1ac089" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186367906 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\pi }^{2}+\\pi +\\frac{1}{2}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [1759218636